keiko 1
# S3 (exact temp-path obstruction) — saving over an occupied slot with the
# writer's own temp path obstructed fails, leaves the old slot's park untouched
# and notifies; removing the obstruction lets the retry land and load again.
# Excluded: the on-disk byte equality of the old slot (the case proves the slot
# still reports its park; the byte comparison is the rule test's job).
fixture slot-1 fixtures/slot-reunion.ron
fault write-blocked slot-1
setting play.text_speed 0

new-game
expect surface play
expect slot 1 scene reunion
save 1
activate confirm.yes
expect surface menu
expect notice contains "couldn't save"
expect slot 1 scene reunion
unblock slot-1
save 1
activate confirm.yes
expect surface menu
expect slot 1 scene first_meeting
menu
expect surface play
advance
expect line "You're not from around here, are you?"
load 1
activate confirm.yes
expect surface play
expect line "Morning light. A folded letter on the ground, half under a shoe."
